Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:45.24,LIVE Zeal,NTP,0,0,0,,為了{\3c&H0AD8A6&}保護{\3c&HEFA639&}一切 鬥志 {\3c&H0203E4&}昂揚 {\3c&H0AD8A6&}疾跑！
